ds: 8192 rule frames, 4096 SLL lookahead links, 256 full-LL links, on a 16 MiB parse thread): the review's repros, at/over per shape against the predicted table, 10x the old crash depths, the JVM's packets (incl. a 20,000-deep 1+ tree), the old crash depths in children on the jolt thread, injected C++ faults, the abort-is-a-failure property, lifecycle and unavailable-library legs. Args select legs: budget below crash inject abort unavailable (needs bb build:jolt-native)\\\"\\n56\\t   :task (System/exit\\n57\\t           (:exit (apply shell {:continue true} \\\"bb\\\" \\\"src/dev/jolt_j5_run.clj\\\" *command-line-args*)))}\\n58\\t\\n59\\t  calibrate:jolt-j5\\n60\\t  {:doc \\\"J5b C4 + J5c: build the guards-off calibration variant of native/jolt-parser and record each nesting shape's stack cost per rule frame and per lookahead link on the 16 MiB parse thread (asserting every bound fits a quarter of the stack; writes build/j5b/calibration.edn), or, with --work, the work metric's per-shape counts and the corpus sweep the work bound derives from (writes build/j5b/work.edn; needs bb build:jolt-native)\\\"\\n61\\t   :task (System/exit\\n62\\t           (:exit (apply shell {:continue true} \\\"bb\\\" \\\"-cp\\\" \\\"src/dev\\\"\\n63\\t                         \\\"src/dev/jolt_j5_calibrate.clj\\\" *command-line-args*)))}\\n64\\t\\n65\\t  probe:jolt-file\\n66\\t  {:doc \\\"J4a: native/jolt-file gates, each in a child process: JVM-identical frame bytes (both hash algorithms), F2 s32BE prefixes, strict reads, injected short/EINTR/zero-progress/error transfers, corrupt-open byte identity, idempotent close, no fd or native-memory leak, a full collection during a 1 GiB :blocking pwrite, missing/wrong-layout wrapper refused before guest work, exported-symbol allowlist (needs bb build:jolt-native)\\\"\\n67\\t   :task (System/exit\\n68\\t           (:exit (shell {:continue true} \\\"bb\\\" \\\"native/jolt-file/probes/run.clj\\\")))}\\n69\\t\\n70\\t  probe:jolt-udp\\n71\\t  {:doc \\\"