he fable short re-read of the fix-round diff per the sign-off's D3, then J6d closes. (2) The P6 plan review dispatched to kimi (its third delegation; the standard plan-review brief with the tree-verification list). (3) The P4 S6 shiva verification re-queued (the earlier run was interrupted).\\norchestrator-logs/1793179048-yang-p\\n\\n[elided: chars [4096, 54606)]\\n\\n[preview: chars [54606, 55630)]\\nd.\\ndocs/opencode.md:22:| Interrupt             | Escape                |\\norchestrator-logs/1793203595-jolt-j4d-j5-orchestration.md:38:- Jupiter's safepoint run (the zero-pin Linux evidence for J2) completed:\\norchestrator-logs/1793203595-jolt-j4d-j5-orchestration.md:102:- The J2 evidence completed on both platforms (the safepoint zero-pin\\ndocs/cesk-space-optimization.md:85:promoted at safepoints.\\ndocs/cesk-space-optimization.md:117:### 3. Alternative to 1 if full incrementality is too invasive: fold at safepoints\\ntest/resources/dao/space/datomic-q-v1.errata.md:134:  `:timeout` or `:step-budget-exhausted` (`:cognitect.anomalies/interrupted`)\\ndocs/agents/build-n-test.md:44:# yang.python.antlr e2e, e2e-c1, prelude-parity, safepoint, float-address\\ndocs/agents/build-n-test.md:531:  `yin.vm.semantic.safepoint-harness-test` needs one — see\\ndocs/agents/build-n-test.md:535:  (J2 closure, the safepoint 60/265,225/0 pass) was all produced `jobs 1`.\\nResults truncated to 200 lines (total: 2315). Use offset=200 to see more.\"}\ncollab/orch-lane/1793545000000-architect-p4-stress-budget-ruling.kimi-k3.1-pro.stdout.log:7:{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"type\":\"function\",\"id\":\"tool_bMnC1n7SM4S5sSBc0P1F3OFW\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"Glob\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"**/yang.php.md\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-php-p4\\\"}\"}},{\"type\":\"function\",\"id\":\"tool_r7jiAGMQPz0StkZz6cTIjcPA\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"Grep\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"safepoint|budget|Interrupt\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/sto/works